{"id": "H10", "category": "stats", "question": "Compare Arsenal and Liverpool in 2024/25.", "answer": "Here is the comparison between Arsenal and Liverpool in the **2024/25** Premier League season:\n\n### **Overall Records**\n* **Liverpool:** 1st place | 38 played | 25 wins | 9 draws | 4 losses | 86 goals for | 41 goals against | +45 goal difference | **84 points**\n* **Arsenal:** 2nd place | 38 played | 20 wins | 14 draws | 4 losses | 69 goals for | 34 goals against | +35 goal difference | **74 points**\n\n---\n\n### **Home & Away Splits**\n\n* **Liverpool**\n  * **Home:** 19 played | 14 wins | 4 draws | 1 loss | 42 goals for | 16 goals against | **46 points**\n  * **Away:** 19 played | 11 wins | 5 draws | 3 losses | 44 goals for | 25 goals against | **38 points**\n\n* **Arsenal**\n  * **Home:** 19 played | 11 wins | 6 draws | 2 losses | 35 goals for | 17 goals against | **39 points**\n  * **Away:** 19 played | 9 wins | 8 draws | 2 losses | 34 goals for | 17 goals against | **35 points**", "tools": ["team_record", "home_away_split", "league_table"], "tool_calls": [{"tool": "team_record", "args": {"season": "2024/25", "team": "Arsenal"}, "duration_ms": 16.6, "error": null, "response_preview": "{\"team\": \"Arsenal\", \"season\": \"2425\", \"matches_counted\": 38, \"played\": 38, \"wins\": 20, \"draws\": 14, \"losses\": 4, \"goals_for\": 69, \"goals_against\": 34, \"goal_difference\": 35, \"points\": 74}"}, {"tool": "team_record", "args": {"team": "Liverpool", "season": "2024/25"}, "duration_ms": 11.2, "error": null, "response_preview": "{\"team\": \"Liverpool\", \"season\": \"2425\", \"matches_counted\": 38, \"played\": 38, \"wins\": 25, \"draws\": 9, \"losses\": 4, \"goals_for\": 86, \"goals_against\": 41, \"goal_difference\": 45, \"points\": 84}"}, {"tool": "home_away_split", "args": {"season": "2024/25", "team": "Arsenal"}, "duration_ms": 11.3, "error": null, "response_preview": "{\"home\": {\"played\": 19, \"wins\": 11, \"draws\": 6, \"losses\": 2, \"goals_for\"